          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "banquete is usually traced to French banquet or Italian banchetto, a small form of banco 'bench', a Germanic word. The feast was named after the little benches the guests sat on."
            }
          ]
        },
